{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"The repo keeps terminal behavior in `src/ui.rs`, with the harness and app forwarding byte/key input into that UI state. I’m reading those paths next so visual selection lands in the shared renderer instead of just one frontend."}}
