{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"agent_message","text":"No external clipboard crate is exposed in the app, and this terminal writes ANSI directly, so I’m treating copy as an internal yank register with a status confirmation. That gives tests a concrete API and avoids adding a platform clipboard dependency for this focused UI feature."}}
